699
00:41:39,598 --> 00:41:42,000
Aku masih mencintainya.

700
00:41:44,502 --> 00:41:47,906
Maksudku, itulah kata-kata terakhirnya.

701
00:41:48,239 --> 00:41:49,407
Itu tak penting.

702
00:41:51,242 --> 00:41:52,811
Itu penting bagiku.

703
