1302
01:21:01,824 --> 01:21:03,259
Oh, tidak, tidak. Tidak apa-apa.

1303
01:21:03,960 --> 01:21:05,161
Kemarilah.

1304
01:21:05,828 --> 01:21:06,829
Kemarilah.

